---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import FAQ from '@components/FAQ.astro';
import AnswerBlock from '@components/AnswerBlock.astro';
import DemoStream from '@components/DemoStream.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'How it works', url: '/how-it-works' },
];

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'How long does deployment take?',
    a: 'From signed engagement, most firms see their first production AI workflow live within four to six weeks. Pilot length scales with the number of workflows in scope and the complexity of the integrations.'
  },
  {
    q: 'Who is involved on our side?',
    a: 'A typical engagement involves a sponsor (CEO or COO), an operational owner (practice manager, COO, or IT lead), and a compliance reviewer. We work with whatever team structure your firm has. We do not require you to hire AI specialists.'
  },
  {
    q: 'Can we add workflows after launch?',
    a: 'Yes. The initial deployment covers two to three high-leverage workflows. New workflows are added through a defined scoping process, typically two to four week sprints per workflow.'
  },
  {
    q: 'How do you measure success?',
    a: 'We define success metrics with you during the readiness assessment. Typical metrics include time saved per workflow, throughput per user, response time on intake, and qualitative satisfaction scores from your team. We review monthly.'
  },
];
---
<PageLayout
  title="How Fortify AI Works : Methodology, deployment, and managed operations"
  description="Fortify AI is delivered in four stages: 30 minute consultation, readiness assessment, two to four week pilot, then managed rollout. From signed engagement to first production workflow in four to six weeks."
  eyebrow="Methodology"
  pageHeading="From first conversation to live deployment in four to six weeks."
  pageLead="Fortify AI follows a defined four-stage process designed for firms that need AI capability fast, configured to their compliance environment, and operated by a team they trust."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  faqs={faqs}
  speakable={['.answer-block__a']}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <AnswerBlock>
        <p>i-NETT deploys Fortify AI as a fully managed service: we configure the AI infrastructure to your specific regulatory environment, isolate it to a dedicated tenant so your data stays separate from every other client, and our managed services team operates and monitors it on an ongoing basis. Deployments are designed to meet HIPAA, GDPR, SOC, and CCPA requirements and are reviewed alongside your compliance team before going live. Your data is never used to train models and is never shared across clients, and through i-NETT's Lloyd's of London partnership, the firms we manage can qualify for discounted cyber insurance that reflects the strength of the managed security posture.</p>
      </AnswerBlock>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LIVE SCRIPTED DEMO -->
  <DemoStream />

  <!-- STAGES -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <ol class="stages">
        <li class="stage">
          <header class="stage__head">
            <span class="stage__num">Stage 1</span>
            <h2>30 minute consultation</h2>
            <p class="stage__when">Week 0 &middot; No engagement required</p>
          </header>
          <div class="stage__body">
            <p>
              We meet with your leadership team to scope your environment, your compliance
              footprint, and the two or three highest-leverage AI deployments for your firm.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Map your current systems and data sources</li>
              <li>Identify your regulatory constraints (HIPAA, GDPR, SOC, CCPA, industry-specific)</li>
              <li>Surface the workflows where AI returns the most value in the first 90 days</li>
              <li>Walk through what a Fortify AI engagement would look like for your firm</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Output:</strong> A written summary of fit, scope, and indicative timeline.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="stage">
          <header class="stage__head">
            <span class="stage__num">Stage 2</span>
            <h2>Readiness assessment</h2>
            <p class="stage__when">Weeks 1 to 2 &middot; Engagement signed</p>
          </header>
          <div class="stage__body">
            <p>
              Our deployment team conducts a structured readiness assessment of your environment.
              We map data sources, integration points, regulatory constraints, and team readiness.
              Your compliance reviewer is engaged from this stage forward.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Data source inventory and access review</li>
              <li>System integration mapping</li>
              <li>Regulatory configuration plan</li>
              <li>Role-based access model designed for your team structure</li>
              <li>Success metrics defined with your sponsor</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Output:</strong> A written readiness scan, configuration plan, and reviewed scope document.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="stage">
          <header class="stage__head">
            <span class="stage__num">Stage 3</span>
            <h2>Pilot deployment</h2>
            <p class="stage__when">Weeks 2 to 6 &middot; Live in your environment</p>
          </header>
          <div class="stage__body">
            <p>
              We deploy Fortify AI on the highest-leverage workflow first. Your dedicated
              tenant is provisioned. Your data sources are connected within the approved
              integration scope. Your team is enabled with role-appropriate access.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Dedicated tenant provisioned and configured</li>
              <li>First workflow live for a defined user group</li>
              <li>Audit logging enabled, compliance review scheduled</li>
              <li>User enablement sessions for your team</li>
              <li>Weekly review meetings with your sponsor</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Output:</strong> One live, measured workflow, plus a documented configuration ready for compliance review.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="stage">
          <header class="stage__head">
            <span class="stage__num">Stage 4</span>
            <h2>Managed rollout</h2>
            <p class="stage__when">Week 6 onward &middot; Ongoing</p>
          </header>
          <div class="stage__body">
            <p>
              We expand to your full team and bring additional workflows into production
              on a defined cadence. i-NETT operates the deployment from this point forward.
              You use it. We run it.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Workflow expansion in two to four week sprints</li>
              <li>24/7 monitoring through the Technology Assurance Group network</li>
              <li>Continuous model evaluation and version management</li>
              <li>Quarterly compliance review with your reviewer</li>
              <li>Monthly success metric reporting to your sponsor</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Output:</strong> A measured, operating, compliance-reviewed AI environment that grows with your firm.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STACK -->
  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">The stack</span>
      <h2>Built on production-grade infrastructure.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Fortify AI is assembled from production-grade model providers, cloud infrastructure,
        and governance tooling. We select model providers based on your compliance footprint,
        your data residency requirements, and the workflow being deployed.
      </p>
      <ul class="stack-list">
        <li><strong>Model providers.</strong> Enterprise-tier offerings from leading frontier model providers, selected per deployment based on compliance, data residency, and workflow fit.</li>
        <li><strong>Cloud infrastructure.</strong> Enterprise cloud with private networking, encryption at rest and in transit, and regional data residency controls.</li>
        <li><strong>Identity and access.</strong> Single sign-on integration with your existing identity provider. Role-based access enforced at every layer.</li>
        <li><strong>Governance.</strong> Audit logging, content filtering, prompt and response logging for compliance review, model evaluation, and policy enforcement.</li>
        <li><strong>Managed operations.</strong> i-NETT operations team, backed by the Technology Assurance Group network. ISO 27001 aligned.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="disclaimer">
        Built for HIPAA, GDPR, SOC, and CCPA compliance. Deployments are configured to your
        regulatory environment and reviewed by your compliance team. Discounted cyber
        insurance through our Lloyd&rsquo;s of London partnership.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQ items={faqs} />
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .stages {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    counter-reset: stage;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-7);
  }
  .stage {
    padding: var(--space-7);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 880px) {
    .stage { grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr; gap: var(--space-7); }
  }
  .stage__head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .stage__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent-500);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .stage__when {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }
  .stage__body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); }
  .stage__body ul {
    padding-left: 1.25em;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }
  .stage__body strong { color: var(--color-ink-800); }

  .stack-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-6) 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .stack-list li {
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-500);
  }
</style>
